.W.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Pentavalent antimony&#x02013;mannan conjugate therapy of experimental visceral leishmaniasis</article-title><source>Am J Trop Med Hyg</source><volume>55</volume><year>1996</year><fpage>444</fpage><lpage>446</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8916804</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="bib36"><label>36</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Negre</surname><given-names>E.</given-names></name><name><surname>Chance</surname><given-names>M.L.</given-names></name><name><surname>Hanboula</surname><given-names>S.Y.</given-names></name><name><surname>Monsigny</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Roche</surname><given-names>A.C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Mayer</surname><given-names>R.M.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Antileishmanial drug targeting through glycosylated polymers specifically internalized by macrophage membrane lectins</article-title><source>Antimicrob Agents Chemother</source><volume>36</volume><year>1992</year><fpage>2228</fpage><lpage>2232</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1332591</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="bib37"><label>37</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Larabi</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Yardley</surname><given-names>V.</given-names></name><name><surname>Loiseau</surname><given-names>P.M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Appel</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Legrand</surname><given-names>P.</given-names></name><name><surname>Gulik</surname><given-names>A.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Toxicity and antileishmanial activity of a new stable lipid suspension of amphotericin B</article-title><source>Antimicrob Agents Chemother</source><volume>47</volume><year>2003</year><fpage>3774</fpage><lpage>3779</lpage><pub-id p